    <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">More than the name suggests</div>

    <p class="cc-name-lead">
      The name <em>certification course</em> can be misleading. Yes — it
      leads to the certificate, to opening your own practice, to weaving
      Somatic Vocal Healing into the work you already do. But that is only
      part of it. At heart, this is a deepening journey — a path that takes
      you further into the work than anything else we offer, because you
      never walk it alone: the weekly Q&amp;As, the practice sessions and
      the monthly deepenings are held live, with us in the room together,
      through the end of 2026.
    </p>

